---
source: core/src/orchestrator.rs
expression: tool_to_json(&tool)
---
description: "Query your own memory across all layers. Use this when you need to recall what you know about the user, review past conversations, or search for specific information in your memory. Without a query, lists all stored facts and recent messages. With a query, searches across all memory layers. Supports pagination via offset/limit for large result sets."
name: recall_memory
parameters:
  properties:
    layer:
      description: "Memory layer to query. Default: 'all'. L3 full-text search requires a query."
      enum:
        - all
        - l1
        - l2
        - l3
      type: string
    limit:
      description: "Max entries per page (default 20, max 50)."
      type: integer
    offset:
      description: Pagination offset (default 0). Use to retrieve more results after truncation.
      type: integer
    query:
      description: "Optional search term. If empty/omitted, returns all L1+L2 entries. If provided, searches across L1 (substring), L2 (substring), and L3 (full-text)."
      type: string
  required: []
  type: object
